'''Sunrise''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was obtainable from unboxing the Summer Mystery Box in the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
The gun has an indigo-to-yellow colorized fade throughout the barrel of the gun, resembling a sunrise, hence the name. The cylinders of the gun resembles as a sun, like [[Sunset (Knife)]]. The neon-yellow sun is surrounded by purple clouds, some making up the hammer and handle of the gun.

== Trivia ==
*It pairs with the godly [[Sunset (Knife)|Sunset]] making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Sun Set|Sun Set]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart called [[Chroma Sunrise]].
*Sunrise has a [[FX Weapons|FX]] tag along with its counterpart Sunset. 

